--- OLD
  @UpDown:
    LDA cursor              ; if up/down, simply toggle the cursor between New Game
    EOR #1                  ;  and continue
    STA cursor
--- NEW
  @UpDown:
    ;  Seven rows rather than two, a two by two among them, so this is no
    ;  longer a toggle.  A still holds the direction bits, which is what
    ;  tells up from down.
    JSL opt_titleupdown + OPTFAR
